# Captures, downloaded datasets, caches and outputs — never leave the machine (they hold GPS, MACs, SSIDs).
# This also keeps license-encumbered bulk data (e.g. the BLEScope UUID set) out of the repo.
data/
logs/
out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.part

# Generated by `fetch` (dataset list + download hashes); regenerated each run.
SOURCES.md

# Demo captures are generated by demo/make_demo.py — regenerate, don't commit (the .kismet is a binary SQLite file).
demo/*.ndjson
demo/*.kismet
